			<div class="content" id="post-content-2419081">
									

<p>Firstly, thanks to reviewers such as kaktus, Decibelles, sirpudding, Zyn and DreamwalkerFae. Especial thanks to Dr Solo since he did &quot;bring&quot; more reviewers than I would usually muster via forum, and sped up the process.</p>
<p>Secondly, credit's due where they're due.</p>
<ul>
<li>OBSKURA is taken from the GOC Canon Hub, which is compiled by Clef.</li>
<li>The Rite of Nyúz is a concept from Metaphysician's sandbox on Sarkicism, which is described as the &quot;methodical removal of portions of the body over an extended period of time, eventually resulting in death.&quot;</li>
</ul>
<p>This article features: Sarkcism Hub, as compiled by Metaphysician</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
