<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>SCP-2430 is effectively a combination of Sæhrímnir, Tanngrisnir and Tanngnjóstr – three creatures in Norse myths that can regenerate their flesh.</p>
<p>Between building an army of unstoppable flesh things and making a meat puppet of someone you hate, which would you choose?</p>
<p>And as for the &quot;Uralic flesh-crafters&quot;&#8230; Sarkicists, much?</p>
</div>
</div>
